Emit --count events of EVERY modality (all 12) in one run, flush, and print a per-modality result table parsed from the backend's batch responses. Emits one event of every modality.

Usage: wally telemetry blast [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
      --count POSITIVE        Events per modality (default 1)
      --session-id TEXT       Session id attached to every event (default: fresh
                              UUID)
      --processing-ms FLOAT   processing_time_ms metric for every event
      --input-tokens INT      input_tokens metric (llm/vlm modalities)
      --output-tokens INT     output_tokens metric (llm/vlm modalities)
